    intro="Business project management is the use of project management methods to deliver change inside a business, such as a new system, product, location or process, and to make sure that change produces the benefits that justified it. This guide covers the types of business project, the life cycle from idea to benefits review, a 10-step process, how to prioritise projects against strategy and a worked example with a business case, benefits register and change decision.",
